{"id": "EUVD-2026-103512", "enisaUuid": "62a8a689-639c-32f9-bd86-e637128a5bff", "description": "Gitify before 7.10.0 contains a login cross-site request forgery vulnerability that allows remote attackers to bind a victim's client to their account because performGitHubWebOAuth() omits OAuth state validation. Attackers can get a gitify://oauth?code= link with their own authorization code opened during a victim's pending login, causing Gitify to display attacker-controlled notifications as the victim's own.", "datePublished": "2026-10-18T12:19:42", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T16:09:30", "baseScore": 2.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/gitify-app/gitify/issues/3425", "https://github.com/gitify-app/gitify/commit/10235b243e167a7c76eafd6a3d0ebc8c575eebc7", "https://github.com/gitify-app/gitify/releases/tag/v7.10.0", "https://github.com/gitify-app/gitify/blob/v7.9.0/src/renderer/utils/forges/github/flows.ts#L35-L76", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/gitify-before-7.10.0-login-csrf-via-missing-oauth-state-validation"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-112050", "GHSA-gh5g-g72j-mxwx"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.15, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "8c2bdd78-2f55-3395-b9d7-3ac457d3debc", "product": {"name": "gitify", "vendor": {"name": "gitify-app"}}, "product_version": "0 <7.10.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "bcd55702-cf5a-38d8-8c9f-99d14fa569f6", "vendor": {"name": "gitify-app"}}], "isExploited": false}